                "text": "A suppression that carries no reason, in any of the three documents: an inline directive, an ignore-file entry or a baseline row."
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A suppression that carries no reason, in any of the three documents: an inline directive, an ignore-file entry or a baseline row. For the ignore file and the baseline, an entry or a row whose reason field is absent, empty or whitespace only is refused and reported rather than matched."
              },
              "help": {
