              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A suppression that matches no current finding, at either mechanism and in the baseline alike. The run exits with the findings code when at least one is reported. The kind is fixed on at deny: no flag, no severity setting and no per-mechanism exception reduces it below a finding, and a configuration naming this code under a severity key is an unimplemented key."
              },
